  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"70a6ffc9-7d3b-472d-b886-39c63de6fa50\">\n  <figure>\n    <img src=\"/images/articles/70a6ffc9-7d3b-472d-b886-39c63de6fa50-1.jpg\" alt=\"Warm sunset sky behind silhouetted palm fronds\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </figure>\n\n  <div class=\"poem\">\n    <p>O, Lord, breathe your life in each<br>\n    word that I speak;<br>\n    Help me in each sentence your<br>\n    honour to seek.<br>\n    Refrain me when words that will<br>\n    do no one good<br>\n    Would come to my lips; help me<br>\n    speak what I should.<br>\n    And when opportunity<br>\n    comes on my way<br>\n    To witness for you, guide, O<br>\n    Lord, what I say.<br>\n    O give me the courage to<br>\n    speak as I ought--<br>\n    To lift up your name and the<br>\n    things you have taught;<br>\n    That none have occasion my<br>\n    speech to condemn,<br>\n    That through my words Christ would be<br>\n    shining to them.</p>\n\n    <p class=\"byline\"><em>~Rebecca Weber</em></p>\n  </div>\n</article>\n",
